  "statement": "# 枪火地牢 — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\n在俯视地牢中移动、瞄准和射击，在有限资源与持续敌压下完成一段有终点的突围。\n\n## Scope boundary\n\n一个紧凑的俯视射击地牢流程，包含战斗反馈、阶段推进、死亡/失败、重试以及明确胜利。\n\n## Required controls\n\nThis task requires at least 2 declared extended actions in `gb_levels.json.extended_actions` (extra InputMap verbs beyond the eight canonical `gb_*` actions, each bound to a real key and read in gameplay code) covering: a manual reload; a weapon switch (both separate from the fire button). Choose your own stable ids. Holding every declared extra from frame 0 must not clear the game.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\n可以自行决定房间拓扑、敌人组合、武器与升级、掉落节奏和美术编排。\n"
}
